+  // Stream-deadline sweep (deliver the error, then reset), queued churn/policy closes, reassembly and
+  // egress byte-budget eviction (fattest pooled first, 503), count-budget eviction (the busiest IP's
+  // least recently active, 503), inactivity sweep (LRU front, ok), discourage and rate-limiter cleanup
+  // on their own cadence. Call from the handle_timeouts slot.
+  void tick(td::Timestamp now);
